{"4469120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Martha's Dolls 2", "steam_appid": 4469120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/b93d8bc10eb335fbedb3edc867840566.avif?t=1788316132\" width=874 height=164 /></span><br><br>After the events of <strong>Chapter 1</strong>, the legend of <strong>Martha</strong> and her porcelain collection has only grown darker. Local rumors have turned into a morbid fascination for the brave and the foolish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/66936cda08f41c298b0b5ffd7722ddfa.poster.avif?t=1788316132\" width=630 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/66936cda08f41c298b0b5ffd7722ddfa.webm?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/66936cda08f41c298b0b5ffd7722ddfa.mp4?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a seasoned <strong>urban explorer and adventurer</strong>, drawn to the house by the whispered tragedies of the Martha estate. You aren't just here for the thrill; you’re here for the truth. But as you cross the threshold, you realize the house hasn't been as empty as the town believes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/813123b50373f1f966e5089d765fd6da.poster.avif?t=1788316132\" width=630 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/813123b50373f1f966e5089d765fd6da.webm?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/813123b50373f1f966e5089d765fd6da.mp4?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mystery Deepens</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar halls of Martha's House return, but they feel... different. You quickly discover you weren't the first one to come looking for answers. Scattered notes and abandoned gear suggest others entered before you and <strong>none of them ever came out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/d7eb5c98fe036d53c225f0103603543d.avif?t=1788316132\" width=874 height=164 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to Martha’s House:</strong> Explore the iconic location from Chapter 1, now featuring expanded rooms, hidden crawlspaces, and secrets that were previously locked away.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/aad86694f724c8ba5f1bd12619dac9f3.poster.avif?t=1788316132\" width=630 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/aad86694f724c8ba5f1bd12619dac9f3.webm?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/aad86694f724c8ba5f1bd12619dac9f3.mp4?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dolls are Watching:</strong> The original dolls are back, and they’ve learned from your last visit. Their presence is heavier, and their movements are more calculated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> A refined lighting engine and immersive 3D audio make every floorboard creak feel like a heartbeat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/e0091e32059c4423d34e78a96eb7bcb5.poster.avif?t=1788316132\" width=630 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/e0091e32059c4423d34e78a96eb7bcb5.webm?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/e0091e32059c4423d34e78a96eb7bcb5.mp4?t=1788316132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Here are some of the features of Martha's Dolls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Variety of different dolls, each with its own unique abilities and behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging and suspenseful horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Maze-like village full of traps and hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark and atmospheric world to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gripping story to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic Horror Experience !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All what you need ( Inventory System , Player Items , Puzzles ...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a fan of horror games, then Martha's Dolls is a must-play. It is a truly terrifying and unforgettable experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469120/extras/b93d8bc10eb335fbedb3edc867840566.avif?t=1788316132\"